WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:09.559
Identify currency bill with Seeing AI
One of the things that Seeing AI can do is

00:00:09.559 --> 00:00:12.030
recognize currency bills.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.860
Currently, we only do US dollars.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:21.660
This is important because US currency is all
the same size and even the same color.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.300
So, it’s hard to differentiate.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.820
What some people would do then is folded it
into different shapes or put it in different

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.220
parts of your wallet.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:36.410
But to do that, you still need to go through
and identify each of the notes.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.760
You can do this with our currency channel.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.899
Simply place a phone over a note and hear
the denomination.

00:00:43.899 --> 00:00:48.399
It’s lunchtime here, so let’s see how
much money I have here.

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:51.089
I’m just gonna put the phone over the bill.

00:00:51.089 --> 00:00:53.469
 One US dollar
One dollar.

00:00:53.469 --> 00:00:56.100
Unfortunately, that’s not gonna buy much
today.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.959
Let’s see what else I have.

00:00:58.959 --> 00:01:01.649
 20 US dollars
Cool!

00:01:01.649 --> 00:01:04.970
20 dollars, that’s more like it.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:09.990
You’ll see that this is quite a nice $20
bill.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:12.860
What about if it was all scrumpled up.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:18.840
Let me do that for you and let’s see it
looks a bit older now.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:22.230
So, let’s see what is gonna say now.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:24.030
 20 US dollars
Cool!

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:25.530
So just as fast.

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:30.310
it’s recognizing notes that are just not
as pristine.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:31.990
That’s currency for you.

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.590
Let’s go and get some lunch!

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.409
Microsoft logo appears.

